{"version":1,"content":"<p>衛生防護中心今日（2日）錄得一宗兒童感染流感嚴重個案，涉及一名過往健康良好的7歲女童，她的呼吸道樣本經化驗後，證實對甲型（H1）流感病毒呈陽性反應，臨牀診斷為甲型流感併發嚴重肺炎，目前情况嚴重，正於廣華醫院兒童深切治療部留醫。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T10:42:16.651283+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:14:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T14:18:32.570449+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T10:38:18.820198+00:00","content_hash":"ca4a1371834074441d61b9b317b4a479dbcbba45fa5f3259ecf3e7cb73bb3a4a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}